refused: d341_a_bound_on_a_secret_needs_a_check.cy:6:47, line 6 column 47
 6 |     let $small: u8.secret[min: 0, max: 100] = $byte plus.wrap 1;
   |                                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 what: this needs a check to go into `u8.secret[min: 0, max: 100]`, which branches on the secret
 why:  a bound on a secret is allowed only where the check is proven away, since the check itself is a branch (D341)
